"Second energy wave",share_tod_evening_lbl:"AFTER WORK",share_tod_evening_sub:"Transition into calm",share_tod_forenoon_lbl:"MORNING",share_tod_forenoon_sub:"Focus & energy",share_tod_late_lbl:"NIGHT",share_tod_late_sub:"Quiet moments",share_tod_lunch_lbl:"LUNCH BREAK",share_tod_lunch_sub:"Power for the afternoon",share_tod_morning_lbl:"GOOD MORNING",share_tod_morning_sub:"Fresh start to the day",share_tod_night_lbl:"GOOD EVENING",share_tod_night_sub:"Relaxed into the night",share_user_line:"{{name}} \xb7 took a mindful pause.",sos_all_sessions_used:"Du hast heute bereits alle Sessions genutzt.",sos_anxiety_detail:"4s in \xb7 4s hold \xb7 4s out \xb7 4s hold",sos_before_start:"Before you start",sos_before_step1:"Find a quiet spot \u2013 sit or stand comfortably",sos_before_step2:"Put your phone down or place it in front of you \u2013 no scrolling",sos_before_step3:"Briefly close your eyes and arrive",sos_before_step4:"Take one deep breath \u2013 then start",sos_counting_detail:"4s in \xb7 6s out \xb7 count quietly",sos_disclaimer:"SOS is not a substitute for professional help.\\nFor persistent symptoms, consult a doctor.",sos_modus_label:"SOS MODE",sos_panic_detail:"4s in \xb7 6s out \xb7 no holding",sos_scenario_anger_bd:"deep in \xb7 follow-up breath \xb7 long out",sos_scenario_anger_bl:"Physiological sigh",sos_scenario_anger_desc:"Anger is energy \u2013 it needs a channel. Calm down first, then act.",sos_scenario_anger_label:"Anger & frustration",sos_scenario_anger_step1:"Briefly separate yourself from the situation \u2013 different room or outside",sos_scenario_anger_step2:"Breathe in deeply through the nose \u2013 then pull in a little more",sos_scenario_anger_step3:"Forcefully exhale through the mouth \u2013 let it all out",sos_scenario_anger_step4:"Consciously relax jaw, shoulders, and hands",sos_scenario_anger_tip:"Anger under 90 seconds is a body reflex. After that, it's a choice.",sos_scenario_anxiety_bl:"Box breathing",sos_scenario_anxiety_desc:"Anxiety exaggerates. Your body thinks it's in danger \u2013 it isn't.",sos_scenario_anxiety_label:"Anxiety & panic",sos_scenario_anxiety_step1:"Name 5 things you see right now \u2013 out loud or in your head",sos_scenario_anxiety_step2:"Name 4 things you can touch \u2013 touch them",sos_scenario_anxiety_step3:"Name 3 things you hear right now",sos_scenario_anxiety_step4:"Then: 4s in \u2013 4s hold \u2013 4s out \u2013 4s hold",sos_scenario_anxiety_tip:"The 5-4-3 technique pulls your brain out of the anxiety loop into the present. Box breathing keeps it there.",sos_scenario_overwhelm_bl:"Breath counting",sos_scenario_overwhelm_desc:"Too much at once. Your mind is spinning. Let everything go \u2013 for now.",sos_scenario_overwhelm_label:"Overwhelm",sos_scenario_overwhelm_step1:"Write or think: what is the ONE most important thing right now?",sos_scenario_overwhelm_step2:"Everything else doesn't exist for the next minute",sos_scenario_overwhelm_step3:"Count quietly: In (1) \u2013 Out (2) \u2013 up to 10, then restart",sos_scenario_overwhelm_step4:"When thoughts arise: notice, return to counting",sos_scenario_overwhelm_tip:"Counting gives your mind a task \u2013 this stops the carousel more reliably than 'don't think'.",sos_scenario_panic_bl:"Diaphragmatic breathing",sos_scenario_panic_desc:"Panic ends. Always. It feels worse than it is \u2013 your body is deceiving you.",sos_scenario_panic_label:"Panic attack",sos_scenario_panic_step1:"Place one hand on your chest \u2013 feel your heartbeat",sos_scenario_panic_step2:"You are safe. This attack will end within minutes",sos_scenario_panic_step3:"Breathe calmly and evenly \u2013 4s in, 6s out, no holding",sos_scenario_panic_step4:"Say inwardly: My body is protecting me. This will pass.",sos_scenario_panic_tip:"Deep breathing or breath-holding can intensify panic. Diaphragmatic breathing is gentle and without holding.",sos_scenario_stress_bl:"Extended exhale",sos_scenario_stress_desc:"Your nervous system is in alarm mode. One minute is enough to turn the corner.",sos_scenario_stress_label:"Acute stress",sos_scenario_stress_step1:"Breathe in through your nose for 4 seconds \u2013 belly rises",sos_scenario_stress_step2:"Breathe out slowly for 8 seconds \u2013 as long as possible",sos_scenario_stress_step3:"Repeat 3\u20135 times \u2013 your parasympathetic system kicks in",sos_scenario_stress_step4:"Key: exhale twice as long as inhale",sos_scenario_stress_tip:"The extended exhale directly activates the vagus nerve. That's biology, not magic.",sos_screen_sub:"What's happening right now?",sos_screen_title:"Emergency help",sos_start:"Start SOS",sos_start_btn:"\ud83e\udec1 Start {{bl}}",sos_step_1:"Find a quiet place.",sos_step_2:"Sit or stand upright.",sos_step_3:"Place both hands on your belly.",sos_stress_detail:"4s in \xb7 8s out",sos_subtitle:"1-minute emergency relaxation",sos_title:"SOS \u2013 Start Now",sound:"Sound",start_session:"Start session",stat_activity_30_days:"Activity last 30 days",stat_activity_chart:"Activity \u2013 last days (minutes)",stat_activity_month:"Activity \u2013 this month (minutes)",stat_activity_year:"Activity \u2013 this year (min./month)",stat_all_sessions:"All completed sessions.",stat_card_export:"Export & Report",stat_card_goals:"Goals",stat_card_insights:"Insights",stat_create_first:"\uff0b Create first goal",stat_detailed_stats_msg:"Unlock 30-day history, day details and logbook with Pro",stat_detailed_stats_title:"Detailed Statistics",stat_edit_goal:"Edit goal",stat_export_copied_msg:"CSV was copied to clipboard.",stat_export_copied_title:"Export copied",stat_export_fail:"Export not possible",stat_export_hint:"Export as CSV or create your personal annual report as a 5-page luxury PDF.",stat_export_pdf_sub:"PDF \xb7 5 pages \xb7 All statistics",stat_export_section:"Export & Annual Report",stat_export_section2:"\ud83d\udce4 Export & Annual Report",stat_full_stats:"\ud83d\udcca Full statistics",stat_goal_fallback:"Goal",stat_goal_value:"Target value",stat_goals_h